'''Genonian''' (𐑡𐑧𐑯𐑭𐑯𐑦𐑯, ''Ĝenonin'', <small>pronounced</small> [dʒɛnonin]) is a [[SUB-FAMILY languages|SUB-FAMILY language]] within the [[FAMILY language family]], and is written in the [[Genonian script]]<!--Shavian script-->. It is primarily spoken in [[Geno]] by the [[Genonian people]] and serves as the official language of the country, as well as the language of the [[Genonian diaspora]] around Basis. 

